# Deprecated since 2.4, removed in 4.0.
#
# The static template path this extension offered up to version 2.3. It is
# stored in TypoScript records and imported by site packages, so it keeps
# delivering what "All components" delivers, and nothing else. Select "Academic
# Study Plan: All components", or, on TYPO3 v13, depend on the site set
# instead.
#
# The stylesheet and the script of the content element are added to the page
# object by the setup of the component, as this folder did in version 2.3.
@import 'EXT:academic_study_plan/Configuration/TypoScript/ContentElement/setup.typoscript'
